    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Description:</b> </p>

<p>Administrative APIs are accessible over HTTP instead of HTTPS. This exposes the system to interception, tampering, and impersonation via network-based attacks.</p>

<p><b>Impact:</b></p>

<p>Interception of sensitive data, MITM attacks, System Compromise - Reconfigure services, exfiltrate data, or delete records. This could lead to operational disruption and data breach.</p>

<p><b>Mitigation:</b> </p>

<p>All admin APIs must require HTTPS with valid certificates and strong cipher suites.</p>

<p><b>Instructions for Service Team:</b></p>
<ul>
	<li>Security Risk is marked by labels that <b>only SecArch should modify</b> - secarch-risk-level.</li>
	<li>This Security Risk finding will also appear in Security Central aligned with your supplied Phonebook entry.</li>
	<li>Prioritize remediation of this Security Risk in your SDLC in accordance with the <a href="https://confluence.oci.oraclecorp.com/x/2jBLAg" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">OCI SLA for Vulnerability Mitigations</a></li>
</ul>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <br/>

